WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:05.819
So we're continuing sort of our tour through
the absolutely outrageous things that Donald

00:00:05.819 --> 00:00:10.740
Trump said during his rally, like press briefings
at his own golf club over the weekend.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.879
And yes, this is reality as far as we know.

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:18.109
And one of the things he said and that he's
been saying more and more is he's going to

00:00:18.109 --> 00:00:21.289
protect people with preexisting conditions.

00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:26.900
Now, you might hear that and say, wait a I
remember this debate from 10 years ago.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.019
Obamacare protects people with preexisting
conditions.

00:00:30.019 --> 00:00:31.240
And you would be right.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:36.330
One of the big accomplishments of Obamacare
that is very popular with the entire country.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:42.280
It's not just Democrats that, like the preexisting
condition provision, is that Obamacare made

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:47.900
it the law that health insurance companies
can't reject you because you have a preexisting

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:48.900
condition.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.410
They can't reject coverage of that preexisting
condition.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:55.890
This is so popular that now Donald Trump is
just claiming he's going to do it by executive

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.150
order, except, of course, it's already the
law.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:00:59.150
Check this out.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.510
It's really beyond belief.

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:05.580
So over the next two weeks, I'll be pursuing
a major executive order requiring health insurance

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:09.730
companies to cover all preexisting conditions
for all customers.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.010
That's a big thing.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:15.500
I've always been very strongly in favor.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.800
We have to cover preexisting conditions.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:24.070
So we will be pursuing a major executive order
requiring health insurance companies to cover

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:28.800
all preexisting conditions for all of its
customers.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:32.820
This has never been done before, but it's
time that people of our country are properly

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:36.170
represented and properly taken care of.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:41.420
Now, you're not mishearing that Trump is promising
to do something that is already the law thanks

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:42.810
to Obamacare.

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:49.130
If you can believe this, Trump saying this
was reported as breaking news by some media

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.130
outlets.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.870
It was breaking news 10 years ago when the
Affordable Care Act was first signed into

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:53.870
law.

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:59.440
Meanwhile, Trump's own administration is suing
to try to dismantle the Affordable Care Act,

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:01.990
which is what protects people with preexisting
conditions.

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:04.450
That we've never seen anything like this before.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:05.450
We really haven't.

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:08.420
And part of why is because of who's in the
White House.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:11.480
Part of why is because of who supports the
sky.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.569
We've never seen anything like this before.

00:02:13.569 --> 00:02:19.120
Trump is saying, I will sign an executive
order to enforce the law from 2010, which

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:23.319
I've been trying to repeal since I became
president of the United States.

00:02:23.319 --> 00:02:29.500
The provision Trump wants to make law with
an executive order is preexisting.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.990
If you can imagine that we've had it for a
decade now, I actually do not think that this

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.720
is Trump being stupid.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.010
This was a speech that was on paper in front
of him.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.010
Right.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.480
Trump didn't just come up with this out of
thin air.

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.090
He doesn't write the speeches.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:48.100
Obviously, this is a calculation that he can
