00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:07.849
A dozen, maybe two dozen times similarly here.

00:03:07.849 --> 00:03:11.739
Coverage of preexisting conditions is very
popular with Americans, as it should be.

00:03:11.739 --> 00:03:15.510
